    <string name="chat_hello">Ask the knowledge graph</string>
    <string name="chat_hello_sub">Search the fleet\'s code, apps and the web sources by asking. Task, agent, model, mode and MCPs are under the input; your chats are in the menu on the left.</string>
    <string name="chat_hint">Ask Cloud KG Store…</string>
    <string name="chat_send">Send</string>
    <string name="chat_failed">No answer: %1$s</string>
    <string name="models_title">Model and agent</string>
    <string name="models_body">The agent decides who answers (Claude, Hermes, Goose, OpenClaw, or a model through OpenRouter); the model is the one that agent runs when it takes a choice. The same two pickers are above the chat.</string>
    <string name="backend_title">Backend</string>
    <string name="backend_body">The assistant answers from the fleet agent gateway (my-ai-api) over the mesh. The Cloud pages call the fleet services declared in ac_cloud-account (mesh first, then the public route with the fleet sign-in of Cloud Account); the Web pages read the sources Cloud Search declares. This app stores no token: the gateway holds the fleet keys and the fleet bearer is read from Cloud Account on use.</string>
    <string name="backend_gateway">Gateway: %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_title">Cloud KG Store</string>
    <string name="about_body">The fleet\'s knowledge-graph store: Cloud (applications and repositories), Phone (the installed apps index) and Web (news, media, shopping, real estate, jobs, business). Version %1$s, build %2$s.</string>

